        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Which documents are required for RTO transfer when moving a vehicle between Maharashtra and Gujarat?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You will need the original Registration Certificate (RC), valid insurance copy, Pollution Under Control (PUC) certificate, proof of address in the destination state, and a signed transport agreement. Our team also assists with e‑Way bill generation and IBA mover‑code compliance.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my vehicle in real time while it travels from Pune to Ahmedabad?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. All Shree Ashirwad carriers are equipped with satellite GPS devices that provide live location updates via our customer portal or mobile app. You receive instant notifications at each major checkpoint, ensuring full visibility throughout the journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is insurance automatically included in the car transport package?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Every shipment is covered by a 100 % declared‑value, IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance at no extra cost. This policy protects against loss, theft, or accidental damage, giving you peace of mind from pickup in Pune to delivery in Ahmedabad.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How far in advance should I schedule a pickup for my car transport?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We recommend booking at least 48 hours ahead to secure your preferred slot and allow time for documentation. For urgent moves, our express service can arrange same‑day pickup, subject to carrier availability and completion of the required paperwork.</p>
      </div>
